-  /* There is no explicit reset here: the restart is done by the IWDG started in SysInit (Watchdog_Start): ~8 s
-   * during boot, ~1.5 s after Watchdog_EnterRuntime(). Note: an Error_Handler() call before Watchdog_Start()
